

This is Chicago vesion 1.4 for BBBBS! 7-10-92 by Matt English
 This game is actually a combination of 3 games in one!
 For best results, you'll need to have all 3 games set up
 properly.

 I do not take credit for all the time and effort for the original
 writting of Chicago or the conversion to BBBBS. But in this
 version, I have added "The UnderWorld" Casino and fixed a few bugs!
 This game will now play in BBSlocal mode nicely.

 The UnderWorld casino is located at position 25, 25 inside the game.
 At the casino you can play BlackJack and Slot machine (One armed Bandit)
 with your Chicago money! The One armed Bandit game was modified
 by myself to run this way, and BlackJack was entirely written by me.
 Both games will still function fine by themselves if chosen from
 he JumpDoors menu. (BlackJack will also play fine from a shell!)

                        To Set it up.....

 All these files are provided in this archive.

 Put these files in you RexxDoors directory:
                                Chicago.rexx (version 1.4)
                                BlackJack.rexx (version 2.0)
                                One_Armed_Bandit.rexx (version 1.2)

 Make a new directory named RexxDoors/Data/Gangland
 In this directory, put these files:
                                     aliases
                                     instructions
                                     news1
                                     news2
                                     news3
                                     news4
                                     news5
                                     news6
                                     news7
                                     protect
                                     top10

 Make a directory named RexxDoors/Data/Gangbackups
 In this directory put these files:
                                     aliases
                                     instructions
                                     news1
                                     news2
                                     news3
                                     news4
                                     news5
                                     news6
                                     news7
                                     protect
                                     top10

 These are the backup files that are used when the game resets itself.
 The game resets when a player reaches 500,000 points. If you want to
 change this score higher or lower, just search for the variable
                            "wingoal"
 and set it at what ever value you like.

 I hope that makes sense! If you have problems, questions, suggestions,
 or comments call me...

